                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "arenic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7aa34a50-87d1-3a7a-b91d-d8d1b75927c3",
                                        "entry_id": "86bda219-aa1b-35a4-99a9-7dd7f3c99f40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sandy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9598882-9b03-321f-ad13-e286e0229ad9",
                                        "entry_id": "86bda219-aa1b-35a4-99a9-7dd7f3c99f40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to an arena."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db16c287-80a8-4334-8bf0-f3c60bbf29ea",
                                                "sense_id": "b9598882-9b03-321f-ad13-e286e0229ad9",
                                                "text": "The Sports of the Arena. A scene from the coliseum or circus of the prehistoric world, representing the King and Queen of Atlantis, with their courtiers and followers, watching a fierce arenic fight between a mammoth and a buffalo."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "754ece67-b1bc-4910-8031-c027b5d22e89",
                                                "sense_id": "b9598882-9b03-321f-ad13-e286e0229ad9",
                                                "text": "During the week there has been a big arenic fight between two men in the east one the recognized champion of the world, the other a young and new star comparatively."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "052bb116-0ea0-4b61-a6c5-e077ebe5f42a",
                                                "sense_id": "b9598882-9b03-321f-ad13-e286e0229ad9",
                                                "text": "His arenic battle with the bull and saving of the Christian maiden was exciting and splendidly acted."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4761cdfd-d64d-4528-8d57-4f2ac3db97f3",
                                                "sense_id": "b9598882-9b03-321f-ad13-e286e0229ad9",
                                                "text": "A few of the arenic, mid-air, eqestrian,^([sic]) hippodrome and trained animal acts include the famous Bellfords; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb8d5bd7-289c-44c4-8787-fb346f065f45",
                                                "sense_id": "b9598882-9b03-321f-ad13-e286e0229ad9",
                                                "text": "They caused to revert to the white race a championship that was surrendered to the black when he, with comparative ease, gave Jim Jeffries a sleeping potion that sunny afternoon of July 4, 1910, out there in historic Reno, where divorces are easy to get and where fame was invited through the agency of one of the most important arenic battles in the history of the prize ring."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4a72c3e-34b4-482b-8ea6-e95ee6e03eae",
                                                "sense_id": "b9598882-9b03-321f-ad13-e286e0229ad9",
                                                "text": "But the buffalo does possess great quickness of movement. He is almost invariably a victor in those arenic fights with large carnivara though it is generally conceded that the small size of the cages hardly gives the tiger a fair chance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "073b20d9-9674-42e6-8df5-9d8337306c2a",
                                                "sense_id": "b9598882-9b03-321f-ad13-e286e0229ad9",
                                                "text": "Both boys are in wonderful trim and fight fans are all set for one of the greatest arenic battles ever staged in Portsmouth."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bbc6d8b7-988c-4b4a-8586-7b095b051d70",
                                                "sense_id": "b9598882-9b03-321f-ad13-e286e0229ad9",
                                                "text": "Dempsey Has Been In Sixty-Four Arenic Battles / NEW YORK, July 1.—Veterans of numerous gory ring battles, will face each other in the ring when Jack Dempsey defends his heavyweight title against the challenge of Georges Carpentier in the Jersey City ring, July 2."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8dcb5db1-a108-4a0a-b6b8-69c166db97df",
                                                "sense_id": "b9598882-9b03-321f-ad13-e286e0229ad9",
                                                "text": "Still, men who are born with a yen for hammering and who are endowed with arenic talents fight anyway."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76474cfb-2ac6-4a3a-8fe6-247e90fd5ea7",
                                                "sense_id": "b9598882-9b03-321f-ad13-e286e0229ad9",
                                                "text": "Seasoned and skilled political generals, veterans of a thousand arenic battles; strong men who will give and take without quarter, are in the convention, fighting a battle they believe to have been illy planned, illy advised and erroneously conceived."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66b44241-6506-4e86-805b-45d1f7a397a1",
                                                "sense_id": "b9598882-9b03-321f-ad13-e286e0229ad9",
                                                "text": "What shall the next subject be? Someone decides on spanking—the next most popular subject for arenic battles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eeeaef2f-5317-4354-bcce-f94575290560",
                                                "sense_id": "b9598882-9b03-321f-ad13-e286e0229ad9",
                                                "text": "I didn’t go to the cockfights at Baleta Barrio on the road to Taal. Last time I’d lost 200 pesos! Elena loved the wildness, the bloody, arenic battle, the wild cries of the cocks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9cdebd59-46cd-40cd-b91f-c315f85a930c",
                                                "sense_id": "b9598882-9b03-321f-ad13-e286e0229ad9",
                                                "text": "“You are a Martian warrior. This is what they have come to see.” “Who?” “Your audience.” “This is an arenic fight? Gladiatorial?” Sek laughed. “A little grandiose, perhaps. Though, obviously, it is an arranged form of combat.[…]”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
